      "side": 1,
      "message": "Excuse me, the build-in trace you mentioned is the \"#include \u003ctrace/events/block.h\u003e\" file, such as \"trace_block_bio_queue(q, bio);\"? In addition, because of project requirements, and since there is no build-in trace in the submit_bio function,We need to insert a hook into this function to obtain some information, and perform some algorithmic calculations to evaluate the current io pressure situation in multiple dimensions to optimize the performance of the mobile phone.\nSo a new hook is needed.",
      "parentUuid": "611300b7_6167576b",
      "revId": "fdbcdbfbfdfb9a96bdb92967bd9542ed63af8246",
